ce=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="deploy-23"><mxGeometry x="30" y="45" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-25" value="&lt;b&gt;toyol.exe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;panel window, global shortcuts, tray-less overlay" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="deploy-23"><mxGeometry x="30" y="150" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-26" value="&lt;b&gt;useUpdater + updater plugin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;check() at startup and every 6 h (quiet)&lt;br&gt;&quot;Update to x.y.z&quot; chip in the title bar / Settings › About&lt;br&gt;downloadAndInstall() verifies the signature against the pubkey in tauri.conf.json → installer closes the app → relaunch()" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="deploy-23"><mxGeometry x="30" y="255" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-27" value="&lt;b&gt;First start: speech_load&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;model.rs ensure(): download to .partial, resume with Range, 40 attempts 3 s apart → SHA-256 → rename&lt;br&gt;progress → &quot;speech-download&quot; events → title-bar chip&lt;br&gt;speech.rs load(): pick GPU → whisper context → 1 s warm-up pass (shader compile)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="deploy-23"><mxGeometry x="30" y="420" width="320" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="deploy-28" value="&lt;b&gt;%APPDATA%\com.toyol.app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;config.json · autocomplete.json&lt;br&gt;kept across updates" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="deploy-23"><mxGeometry x="410" y="140" widt